# Users (local profile only, username = password): admin (ADMIN), writer (USER_WRITE), reader (USER_READ)

### Send create daily entries POST request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/daily-entries
Authorization: Basic writer writer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dailyEntries": [
    {
      "game": {
        "id" : 1,
        "name": "WhenTaken"
      },
      "player": {
        "id" : 1,
        "name": "Andrzej"
      },
      "date": "2026-09-04",
      "points" : 568,
      "submittedAt": "2026-09-04T07:00:00Z"
    }
  ]
}

### Send get daily ranking GET request
GET http://localhost:8080/api/daily-ranking?date=2026-08-17
Authorization: Basic reader reader

### Send get weekly ranking GET request
GET http://localhost:8080/api/weekly-ranking?year=2026&week=37
Authorization: Basic writer writer

### Send get all games GET request
GET http://localhost:8080/api/games
Authorization: Basic reader reader

### Send get all players GET request
GET http://localhost:8080/api/players
Authorization: Basic reader reader

### Send get daily rankings report (all games) GET request
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports/daily-rankings?from=2026-09-01&to=2026-09-30
Authorization: Basic reader reader

### Send get daily rankings report (single game) GET request
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports/daily-rankings/games/1?from=2026-08-01&to=2026-08-31
Authorization: Basic reader reader

### Send get weekly rankings report (all games) GET request
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports/weekly-rankings?fromYear=2026&fromWeek=30&toYear=2026&toWeek=40
Authorization: Basic reader reader

### Send get weekly rankings report (single game) GET request
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports/weekly-rankings/games/1?fromYear=2026&fromWeek=30&toYear=2026&toWeek=40
Authorization: Basic reader reader

### Send create game POST request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/games
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Geogrid",
  "scoringSystem": "STANDARD"
}

### Send get game by id GET request
GET http://localhost:8080/api/games/1
Authorization: Basic reader reader

### Send create player POST request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/players
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Łucja"
}

### Send get player by id GET request
GET http://localhost:8080/api/players/1
Authorization: Basic reader reader
